    "semanticRules": [
      "`fact_kind`必须是Catalog已注册的Product Fact kind，不由Store发明open value",
      "Fact JSON上限`64 KiB`且大Artifact只含handle。`media_cast|product_metadata`按8.6.19固定`product_fact_id/aggregate_id/revision/commit/evidence/result`，要求全部commit/Source Basis列非NULL。Product Metadata只允许`metadata_observation|western_analysis`，且三个Artifact Manifest列全非NULL、schema固定`VerifiedArtifactManifest@1`、canonical JSON≤`256 KiB`、digest逐字节等于Manifest `manifestDigest`，`artifact_verification_result_count`等于items中去重后的显式verification Result ID数并为`0..256`",
      "Media Cast只允许`metadata_observation|western_match`，三个Manifest列全NULL且该count=0。Observation basis的`source_ref_count=1..16`",
      "Western Product Metadata basis为`2..17`（至少一项Analysis Result加恰一项Normalize Result）",
      "Western Media-Cast basis恰为1项Match Result。其他已注册kind继续服从各自既有精确合同，允许这些PBF-14专用列为NULL且两个count=0，不能被本修正反向套用未定义公式",
      "非NULL `commit_marker`显式FK到`fx_commit_markers(commit_marker)`，`ON DELETE RESTRICT`且唯一，`result_digest`逐字节等于marker所指`fx_event_result_bindings`",
      "`UNIQUE(libra_run_id,fact_kind,fact_revision)`",
      "`INDEX(libra_run_id,fact_kind,fact_revision)`"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`product_fact_id PK, libra_run_id FK, fact_kind, fact_revision, aggregate_id NULL, schema_ref, fact_json, fact_digest, evidence_digest, source_basis_kind(metadata_observation|western_analysis|western_match) NULL, source_basis_id NULL, source_basis_digest NULL, source_ref_count, verified_artifact_manifest_schema_ref NULL, verified_artifact_manifest_json NULL, verified_artifact_manifest_digest NULL, artifact_verification_result_count, commit_payload_schema_ref NULL, commit_payload_digest NULL, event_fence_digest NULL, commit_marker NULL FK UNIQUE, result_digest NULL, committed_at_ms`",
      "constraints": "`fact_kind`必须是Catalog已注册的Product Fact kind，不由Store发明open value；Fact JSON上限`64 KiB`且大Artifact只含handle。`media_cast|product_metadata`按8.6.19固定`product_fact_id/aggregate_id/revision/commit/evidence/result`，要求全部commit/Source Basis列非NULL。Product Metadata只允许`metadata_observation|western_analysis`，且三个Artifact Manifest列全非NULL、schema固定`VerifiedArtifactManifest@1`、canonical JSON≤`256 KiB`、digest逐字节等于Manifest `manifestDigest`，`artifact_verification_result_count`等于items中去重后的显式verification Result ID数并为`0..256`；Media Cast只允许`metadata_observation|western_match`，三个Manifest列全NULL且该count=0。Observation basis的`source_ref_count=1..16`；Western Product Metadata basis为`2..17`（至少一项Analysis Result加恰一项Normalize Result）；Western Media-Cast basis恰为1项Match Result。其他已注册kind继续服从各自既有精确合同，允许这些PBF-14专用列为NULL且两个count=0，不能被本修正反向套用未定义公式；非NULL `commit_marker`显式FK到`fx_commit_markers(commit_marker)`，`ON DELETE RESTRICT`且唯一，`result_digest`逐字节等于marker所指`fx_event_result_bindings`；`UNIQUE(libra_run_id,fact_kind,fact_revision)`；`INDEX(libra_run_id,fact_kind,fact_revision)`"
    },
